OL,3,GNEWSABin collection days to change
OL,4,Aafter rollout issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are set to see their bins
OL,7,Fcollected on different days in a bid to
OL,8,Ftackle problems in "hard to reach"
OL,9,Frural areas.
OL,11,FEast Suffolk Council introduced its
OL,12,FBetter Recycling Scheme in June in line
OL,13,Fwith new government rules, but some
OL,14,Fpeople criticised the new set-up saying
OL,15,Fit took weeks for waste to be
OL,16,Fcollected.
OL,18,FOn Wednesday, the authority met to
OL,19,Fdiscuss changes and possible
OL,20,Fcompensation for residents due to the
OL,21,Fissues during the rollout.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
