OL,3,GNEWSABin collection days to change
OL,4,Aafter rollout issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors voted against compensation
OL,7,Fbut deputy leader Paul Ashton said
OL,8,Froutes would be changed, adding "there
OL,9,Fis more that we want to do to make it
OL,10,Fbetter".
